-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":12,"created_at":"2026-04-26T13:44:50Z","updated_at":"2026-04-30T16:01:13Z","closed_at":"2026-04-30T16:00:53Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118968","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118968","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118968.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118968.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-30T16:00:53Z"},"body":"Bugsquad edit: Fixes #118930\r\n\r\nGPU validation currently seems to throw some errors about the area light lookup table sampler2Ds not having a `VK_FORMAT_FEATURE_SAMPLED_IMAGE_FILTER_LINEAR_BIT` set.\r\nUpdate: I now changed both lookup table textures to have RGBAF format, since on some GPUs, RGBF does not support linear filtering. This fixes the validation error. \r\nThere also was a crash when setting a texture on an area light with `--gpu-validation` on Vulkan, due to `gaussian_blur` being called without `p_8bit_dst`, which this PR fixes. Further validation errors that occur with global illumination independent of area lights remain unaffected.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"http